      "id": 1,
      "text": "Drexel began as an unincorporated community in Jefferson Township, first settled in 1805 by the Samuel Wilson family, drawn to fertile farmland near Dayton.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
